('2a11 - Inference','G2', $p$Jane said, "Come and play." Bill answered, "Fine, but only if your dog Cookie is not there." Which is probably true?$p$, $c$["Bill is scared of Cookie, Jane's dog.","Bill doesn't like the game they are going to play.","Bill wants to watch TV at his own house."]$c$::jsonb, 0, 1),
